      "repair_reason": "- No ClawSweeper repair job is needed; the prior lint blocker is fixed and the remaining action is normal maintainer review plus exact-head CI gating.; Cleared: The diff adds local process stream error handling, a regression test, and a local proof script without new dependencies, downloads, secrets, permissions, or publishing changes. (sha=f1f53f2770e8327c26a22544427413d28c3266d8)",
      "review_summary": "Adds stdout/stderr error handlers to the gateway Gmail watcher, a regression test, and a proof script that emits stream errors through the real watcher path.\n\nPR surface: Source +6, Tests +27, Other +102. Total +135 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible: current main wires piped stdout/stderr data listeners without stream error listeners, and the PR test/proof emit those stream errors. I did not execute the proof locally in this read-only review.",
